{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2023-06-12 13:05:00', 'title': 'SPARTRONICS BEGINS LEGAL CAMPAIGN TO HOLD GENERAC RESPONSIBLE FOR MILLIONS IN UNPAID SUPPLIER BILLS', 'text': 'WILLIAMSPORT, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SPARTRONICS, A LEADING CONTRACT MANUFACTURER OF COMPLEX ELECTRONIC AND ELECTROMECHANICAL DEVICES FOR DEFENSE, MEDICAL AND LIFE SCIENCES SECTORS, ANNOUNCED THE BEGINNING OF A LEGAL CAMPAIGN AGAINST GENERATOR MANUFACTURER GENERAC FOR FAILING TO PAY SUPPLIERS. TWO LAWSUITS FILED FRIDAY ARE IN RESPONSE TO GENERAC REFUSING TO PAY SUPPLIERS MILLIONS OF DOLLARS FOR PARTS THAT GENERAC AUTHORIZED. ADDITIONAL LAWSUITS ARE ANTICIPATED TO FOLLOW. THE FILED LAWSUITS SAY G.'}